<item>
            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-847] ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException in LedgerFragmentReplicator::updateEnsembleInfo</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-847</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException in LedgerFragmentReplicator::updateEnsembleInfo, because update ensemble info might happen after re-read ledger metadata, so the ensemble might already change. if ensemble is already changed, skip replacing the bookie doesn&apos;t exist.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12786455">BOOKKEEPER-847</key>
            <summary>ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException in LedgerFragmentReplicator::updateEnsembleInfo</summary>
